cmu-squad-visor-iff-on = Your optic's IFF comes online. Your gun will hold fire with a friendly in the line of fire.
cmu-squad-visor-iff-off = You switch off your optic's IFF.
cmu-squad-visor-grenades-on = Your optic will mark friendly primed grenades.
cmu-squad-visor-grenades-off = Your optic stops marking friendly grenades.
